  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>The ZOLLER »conDiaZ« was specially designed for measuring and testing diamond-coated stoneworking tools and enables precise contour detection and the determination of correction values for the machine. </p> <p>Fast, intuitive operation delivers efficient, operator-independent measurement results with high process reliability and reproducibility. Thanks to compact axes, telecentric large-image optics, perfect software, and workshop-friendly design», conDiaZ« fits perfectly into existing workflows and allows high-precision analysis directly on the tool—fully integrated into the measurement process.</p>",
